Changelog: 01-11-2026 09:16:58

Release 0.1.0.

Changelog: 01-11-2026 05:34:24

Added. BIOS Reader: the BIOS's setup screens from the maker's BIOS file (the file itself or its zip, picked in core's
browser), hidden menus included (Y), with each setting's default; the BIOS file card names the file's version (ASUS's
version marker), its setup screens and how many menus the BIOS hides. This device reads the device's BIOS version
without an administrator, and its settings (UEFI variables) with one administrator prompt (owner, 01-11-2026), only
reading, never a variable that may hold personal data. The parsers (firmware.py, hii.py) are the BC250 Bazzite
Suite's BIOS Reader's, unchanged. Written from tools/new_app.py's template.
